TEST_DESCRIPTION
Phase 1 is where the two ISAKMP peers establish a secure,
authenticated channel with which to communicate.  This is called the
ISAKMP Security Association (SA). "Aggressive Mode"
accomplish a phase 1 exchange.
Aggressive mode/DUT initiated/Positive
