RFC 2409 s4 p5 Introduction
TEST_METHOD
- ANVL: Externally cause DUT to initiate an ISAKMP SA using
        Aggressive Mode
-  DUT: Establish an ISAKMP SA using Aggressive Mode with ANVL
TEST_CLASSIFICATION
MUST
