TEST_DESCRIPTION
IKE MUST not respond to an incoming ISAKMP packet if the
remaining bits of the Flags field in the ISAKMP Header are not
set to 0.
Main mode/ANVL initiated/Negative
TEST_REFERENCE
NEGATIVE: RFC2408 s3.1 p23 ISAKMP Header Format
TEST_METHOD
- ANVL: Send <HDR,SA> Packet with the REMAINING_BITS set to <REM_BITS>
