RFC 2409 s5.5 p18 Phase 2 - Quick Mode
TEST_METHOD
- ANVL: Establish one ISAKMP SA with DUT
- ANVL: Externally cause DUT to initiate an IPSEC SA
-  DUT: Send <HDR*,HASH(1),SA,Ni> Packet with CKY-I field in
        the HDR set to ANVL's cookie and CKY-R field in the HDR
        set to DUT's cookie
TEST_CLASSIFICATION
MUST
TEST_TOPOLOGY
TOPOLOGY-0

