TEST_DESCRIPTION
Each instance of a Quick Mode uses a unique initialization
vector based off a single ISAKMP SA, in progress at any one
time. A particular ISAKMP SA which itself is identified by the
COOKIES in the ISAKMP header
Quick mode/DUT initiated/Negative
TEST_REFERENCE
NEGATIVE: RFC 2409 s4 p6 Introduction
          RFC 2409 s5.5 p17 Phase 2 - Quick Mode
TEST_METHOD
- ANVL: Establish one ISAKMP SA with DUT
- ANVL: Externally cause DUT to initiate one IPSEC SA
-  DUT: Send <HDR*,HASH(1),SA,Ni,KE> Packet
- ANVL: Send <HDR*,HASH(2),SA,Nr,KE> Packet with CKY-I
        field set to 0
-  DUT: Do not send <HDR*,HASH(3)> packet
TEST_CLASSIFICATION
MUST
