TEST_DESCRIPTION
Each instance of a Quick Mode uses a unique initialization
vector based off a single ISAKMP SA, in progress at any one
time. A particular ISAKMP SA which itself is identified by the
COOKIES in the ISAKMP header
Quick mode/DUT initiated/Negative
