RFC 2409 s4 p6 Introduction
RFC 2409 s5.5 p18 Phase 2 - Quick Mode
TEST_METHOD
- ANVL: Establish one ISAKMP SA with DUT
- ANVL: Externally cause DUT to initiate an IPSec SA
-  DUT: Send <HDR*,HASH(1),SA,Ni,KE> Packet
- ANVL: Verify that <HDR*,HASH(1),SA,Ni,KE> Packet has CKY-I
        in the HDR is set to the Phase1 Initiator Cookie and CKY-R
        in the HDR set to the Phase1 Responder Cookie
TEST_CLASSIFICATION
MUST
TEST_TOPOLOGY
TOPOLOGY-0

